{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15104580","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104580","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:8:1510458001:1":{"text":"Let him go, Perseus... He's gone.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，放手吧……他已经离开我们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63524A5566849E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510458002:0":{"text":"Do you think I can let myself do that?","source_cn":"你觉得我能放手吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435864F0CDB4C3B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510458003:0":{"text":"Why is this happening?!","source_cn":"为什么会这样？谁能回答我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDF4C6DE48C79540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510458004:0":{"text":"I don't have an answer for you right now. And this isn't the time for us to be fighting each other.","source_cn":"我现在无法给你答案。珀尔修斯，现在也不是我们互相争吵的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C23FB6F06A1E951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510458005:0":{"text":"Insects are still crawling out of the floodwaters by the dozens, and people's lives are at stake! We can't waste time pointing fingers! We need to act now!","source_cn":"洪水里还在涌出昆虫，城民的生命还在受到威胁，我们不能把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39FC7F01089ADB01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510458006:1":{"text":"When this is over...","source_cn":"……等一切结束之后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAADE84B97E53082B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510458007:0":{"text":"... we will talk.","source_cn":"给我答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AD5AEC7B09733B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:18:15010455:0":{"text":"You rush to the next rescue point and pull someone from the water. Even though it is already a lifeless body, Perseus refuses to give up.","source_cn":"你们奔向下一处营救点，再次捞起被困居民。尽管居民早就失...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0201CA2052ACFCC6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You rush to the next rescue point and pull someone from the water. Even though it is already a lifeless body, Perseus refuses to give up.","female":"You rush to the next rescue point and pull someone from the water. Even though it is already a lifeless body, Perseus refuses to give up.","variant_male_record_index":"192122","variant_female_record_index":"192123","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"Perseus","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{